&oe=69E23823"}, "display_name": "Archery Land", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DvUZL8mv4XIQ7kNvwEoo8uj&_nc_oc=Adofsb_MnxvUJUQomwQPGNMxIKIxKivEKhdSjq5vfFVJELMeDBfxvfG0WSmtcEU4o0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2yskkle9ppqRLxetxTiMGV65alraAcDvav_FqTdrTt6g&oe=69E234C1"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3CZt06f9SrYQ7kNvwFxULlz&_nc_oc=AdoeG0OyISavtBJVSidg0kXM_tkKdi9OUVpBfBxgUqEr_vIJZNjzFeDrBeBz8xY4EEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3NRH-_9kvEwUTjtBL8iQOMHBqsiqJPtm-SK9C6tt0miA&oe=69E22933"}, {"file_name": "Cover-Square.png", "id": "811623013181900", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974629_811623016515233_3126397619395326849_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=136bkF8QQXkQ7kNvwFNYcht&_nc